# TMDB API Read Access Token (v4 auth) — https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Read by the /api/tmdb proxy (Vercel function) and by the
# vite dev proxy — never baked into the client bundle. Set it in .env locally
# and in Vercel project env vars. Never commit a real token.
TMDB_TOKEN=

# Optional: shared Redis cache for the proxy (survives cold starts, shared
# across all instances). Free at https://upstash.com — create a Redis DB and
# paste its REST URL + token. Without these, the proxy uses in-memory LRU +
# Vercel edge cache only.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
